  dialogues:
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 8011435426411124626, guid: c0f59330606827c44a8d20ea26218b8a, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "Huh, can\u2019t believe my family's little business is shown on here"
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 8011435426411124626, guid: c0f59330606827c44a8d20ea26218b8a, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - You guys had your own business? In Neokalmar?
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 8011435426411124626, guid: c0f59330606827c44a8d20ea26218b8a, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - It was never anything big.
    - "Couldn\u2019t even call it a business as long as i\u2019ve been alive anyway."
    - My folks just refused to let go of it i guess.
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 8011435426411124626, guid: c0f59330606827c44a8d20ea26218b8a, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - I think this is the most I've learnt about your past since meeting you, Leaifa.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 8011435426411124626, guid: c0f59330606827c44a8d20ea26218b8a, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "Soak it up, you\u2019re not gettin\u2019 any more."
